:"e9f8202e-a60b-5e65-a242-1d02190f8f83","kind":"translation","prompt":"Переведи сообщение о достаточном количестве.","position":8,"public_payload":{"source":"У нас достаточно хлеба."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["We have enough bread.","We've got enough bread."]},"reference_answer":"We have enough bread.","incorrect_answer":"We do not have any bread.","explanation":"Enough bread — достаточно хлеба; отрицание any bread означало бы, что хлеба нет."},{"id":"398fdfb2-6d28-5f52-86bd-eb24e6041c71","lesson_id":"09e339df-4a4e-5484-9797-0e4640e6d1aa","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Как сказать «У меня болит голова»?","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"I do a headache."},{"id":"o2","label":"I am a headache."},{"id":"o3","label":"I have a headache."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"В стандартном выражении о головной боли используется have a headache."},{"id":"c2e1b424-6058-5e9b-a8be-a1e6700aeaab","lesson_id":"09e339df-4a4e-5484-9797-0e4640e6d1aa","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери грамматически правильный совет уставшему человеку.","position":2,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"should resting"},{"id":"o2","label":"should to rest"},{"id":"o3","label":"should rest"}],"sentence":"You look tired. You ___."},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"После should нужна начальная форма без to."},{"id":"d5ae73af-cc6b-515b-9830-682f37d88bbc","lesson_id":"09e339df-4a4e-5484-9797-0e4640e6d1aa","kind":"gap","prompt":"Дополни просьбу записать на приём.","position":3,"public_payload":{"sentence":"I would like to make an ___."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["appointment"]},"reference_answer":"appointment","incorrect_answer":"apartment","explanation":"Appointment — запись на приём; apartment — квартира."},{"id":"107f1890-1aa1-5ba6-b250-4b65ff05e51f","lesson_id":"09e339df-4a4e-5484-9797-0e4640e6d1aa","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Выбери ответ на вопрос о самочувствии.","position":4,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"I feel a little better, thanks."},{"id":"o2","label":"It costs six pounds."},{"id":"o3","label":"I am at seven o’clock."}],"lines":[{"speaker":"Friend","text":"How are you feeling today?"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o1"},"reference_answer":"o1","incorrect_answer":"o2","explanation":"Вопрос о самочувствии требует ответа о состоянии, а не цене или времени."},{"id":"d7cccb16-d57a-5a58-9c45-46373ce42882","lesson_id":"09e339df-4a4e-5484-9797-0e4640e6d1aa","kind":"reading","prompt":"Когда назначен приём Норы?","position":5,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"Tuesday at twelve."},{"id":"o2","label":"Tuesday at ten."},{"id":"o3","label":"Monday at ten."}],"passage":"Nora feels unwell and calls the clinic. She asks for an appointment on Monday, but there are no free times that day. The receptionist offers Tuesday at ten. Nora accepts and writes the time in her diary."},"answer_key":{"value":"o2"},"reference_answer":"o2","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Она принимает предложение Tuesday at ten, хотя сначала спрашивает о понедельнике."},{"id":"1011b695-9fef-50df-b91c-5fbeec7c6dfa","lesson_id":"09e339df-4a4e-5484-9797-0e4640e6d1aa","kind":"translation","prompt":"Переведи описание состояния.","position":6,"public_payload":{"source":"Сегодня я чувствую себя лучше."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["I feel better today.","I am feeling better today."]},"reference_answer":"I feel better today.","incorrect_answer":"I feel worse today.","explanation":"Better — лучше; worse означает хуже и меняет смысл."},{"id":"71955c2a-e980-5d1f-bbac-a3bc42c758ca","lesson_id":"09e339df-4a4e-5484-9797-0e4640e6d1aa","kind":"word_order","prompt":"Составь вежливую просьбу о записи на приём.","position":7,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t1","label":"appointment,"},{"id":"t2","label":"make"},{"id":"t3","label":"an"},{"id":"t4","label":"I"},{"id":"t5","label":"Can"},{"id":"t6","label":"please?"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t5","t4","t2","t3","t1","t6"]},"reference_answer":["t5","t4","t2","t3","t1","t6"],"incorrect_answer":["t4","t2","t3","t1","t6","t5"],"explanation":"Make an appointment — записаться на приём; Can I …, please? — вежливая просьба."},{"id":"2976a21a-7c60-5eec-b24b-4aefdafdc781","lesson_id":"09e339df-4a4e-5484-9797-0e4640e6d1aa","kind":"unit_test","prompt":"Повтори грамматику и ситуации уровня A2.","position":8,"public_payload":{"questions":[{"id":"q1","prompt":"Какой вопрос о вчерашнем дне верен?","options":[{"id":"o1","label":"Did you go out yesterday?"},{"id":"o2","label":"Did you went out yesterday?"}]},{"id":"q2","prompt":"Как спросить количество молока?","options":[{"id":"o1","label":"How many milk?"},{"id":"o2","label":"How much milk?"}]},{"id":"q3","prompt":"Как выразить запланированное намерение?","options":[{"id":"o1","label":"We are going to travel."},{"id":"o2","label":"We going travel."}]}]},"answer_key":{"answers":{"q1":"o1","q2":"o2","q3":"o1"},"explanations":{"q1":"После did используется go.","q2":"Milk неисчисляемое: much.","q3":"Нужна полная конструкция are going to travel."}},"reference_answer":{"q1":"o1","q2":"o2","q3":"o1"},"incorrect_answer":{"q1":"o2","q2":"o2","q3":"o1"},"explanation":"Контрольный блок засчитывается при всех верных ответах. Разбор каждого вопроса показан отдельно."},{"id":"2f0992cd-0996-55cf-a869-2eab56349a23","lesson_id":"56b186bb-4b11-539e-b5b2-f46b7d853676","kind":"tenses","prompt":"Выбери форму для вопроса о жизненном опыте.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"Did you ever went"},{"id":"o2","label":"Have you ever been"},{"id":"o3","label":"Are you ever been"}],"sentence":"___ to Scotland?"},"answer_key":{"value":"o2"},"reference_answer":"o2","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Have you ever been …? спрашивает, случалось ли бывать в месте, без конкретной даты."},{"id":"10ab2778-fceb-595c-8e5f-bc41729731ca","lesson_id":"56b186bb-4b11-539e-b5b2-f46b7d853676","kind":"tenses","prompt":"Выбери форму с завершённым периодом last year.","position":2,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"visited"},{"id":"o2","label":"have been visiting"},{"id":"o3","label":"have visited"}],"sentence":"I ___ Edinburgh last year."},"answer_key":{"value":"o1"},"reference_answer":"o1","incorrect_answer":"o2","explanation":"Last year — законченный период, поэтому visited."},{"id":"41feebfb-f5a5-57a8-b55e-4ccabcd4299f","lesson_id":"56b186bb-4b11-539e-b5b2-f46b7d853676","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь слово, означающее «никогда».","position":3,"public_payload":{"sentence":"I have ___ tried surfing, but I would like to."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["never"]},"reference_answer":"never","incorrect_answer":"already","explanation":"Never отрицает наличие опыта. Already означало бы, что опыт уже есть."},{"id":"1a333346-b17d-5eba-8d74-805b563d6e17","lesson_id":"56b186bb-4b11-539e-b5b2-f46b7d853676","kind":"translation","prompt":"Переведи сообщение об уже выполненной работе.","position":4,"public_payload":{"source":"Я уже отправил письмо."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["I have already sent the email.","I've already sent the email."]},"reference_answer":"I have already sent the email.","incorrect_answer":"I have not sent the email yet.","explanation":"Already подчёркивает, что письмо уже отправлено; not … yet означало бы обратное."},{"id":"615f05dd-598c-5ead-8d7e-63023b655c64","lesson_id":"56b186bb-4b11-539e-b5b2-f46b7d853676","kind":"reading","prompt":"Какой вывод об опыте Марты соответствует тексту?","position":5,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"She stopped working for the company three years ago."},{"id":"o2","label":"She visited Japan last spring."},{"id":"o3","label":"The Tokyo trip would be her first visit to Japan."}],"passage":"Marta has worked for a small travel company for three years. She has visited several countries for work, but she has never been to Japan. Last spring she spent a week in Italy. Her manager has just offered her a trip to Tokyo, and she is looking forward to her first visit."},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Она never been to Japan и ждёт first visit. Last spring относится к Италии."},{"id":"b5e7f13a-31a0-5f91-88cc-d43a6944affd","lesson_id":"56b186bb-4b11-539e-b5b2-f46b7d853676","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Выбери ответ о конкретной дате опыта.","position":6,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"I have never taken one."},{"id":"o2","label":"I took one last summer."},{"id":"o3","label":"I have taken one yesterday."}],"lines":[{"speaker":"Ali","text":"Have you ever taken a night train?"},{"speaker":"Bea","text":"Yes, I have."},{"speaker":"Ali","text":"When did you take it?"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o2"},"reference_answer":"o2","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"После уточнения When …? и last summer нужен Past Simple: took."},{"id":"6c83e81d-4928-5e6e-a752-884da50caf9f","lesson_id":"56b186bb-4b11-539e-b5b2-f46b7d853676","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь время, сохранив указание yesterday.","position":7,"public_payload":{"sentence":"I have finished the report yesterday."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["I finished the report yesterday."]},"reference_answer":"I finished the report yesterday.","incorrect_answer":"I have finished the report already.","explanation":"Yesterday требует Past Simple. В корректном ответе сохраняется исходное обстоятельство."},{"id":"465c4336-f33b-50b9-bcea-b31e64f195f3","lesson_id":"56b186bb-4b11-539e-b5b2-f46b7d853676","kind":"word_order","prompt":"Собери вопрос «Ты когда-нибудь жил за границей?»","position":8,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t1","label":"abroad?"},{"id":"t2","label":"you"},{"id":"t3","label":"lived"},{"id":"t4","label":"Have"},{"id":"t5","label":"ever"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t4","t2","t5","t3","t1"]},"reference_answer":["t4","t2","t5","t3","t1"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t5","t3","t1","t4"],"explanation":"В Present Perfect have стоит перед подлежащим, lived — после ever."},{"id":"b3e2affb-fc4e-545a-8fe9-915e4beb99c5","lesson_id":"0f24909a-f2ba-55ee-b85d-2dec43be12e3","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Дополни реальное условие о погоде.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"rains"},{"id":"o2","label":"would rain"},{"id":"o3","label":"will rain"}],"sentence":"If it ___ tomorrow, we will stay indoors."},"answer_key":{"value":"o1"},"reference_answer":"o1","incorrect_answer":"o2","explanation":"В придаточном с if для реального будущего нужен Present Simple: rains."},{"id":"ebe932d8-f15b-5e79-a449-6eaf286ac6dd","lesson_id":"0f24909a-f2ba-55ee-b85d-2dec43be12e3","kind":"gap","prompt":"Дополни главное предложение о возможной задержке.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"If the train is late, we ___ call you."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["will"]},"reference_answer":"will","incorrect_answer":"would","explanation":"Will call — ожидаемое действие при реальном будущем условии."},{"id":"b8a25fb0-b08b-5c8e-af26-d6219e915394","lesson_id":"0f24909a-f2ba-55ee-b85d-2dec43be12e3","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Какой смысл у Unless you hurry, you will miss the bus?","position":3,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"If you hurry, you will miss the bus."},{"id":"o2","label":"You missed the bus because you hurried."},{"id":"o3","label":"If you do not hurry, you will miss the bus."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Unless = if not. Это условие будущего, а не сообщение о прошлом."},{"id":"d12c1cd0-957b-5d8c-9906-55790f279db9","lesson_id":"0f24909a-f2ba-55ee-b85d-2dec43be12e3","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что группа сделает при отмене лодочной экскурсии?","position":4,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"They will take the boat even in strong wind."},{"id":"o2","label":"They will lose all their money."},{"id":"o3","label":"They will visit the science museum."}],"passage":"A group of friends has booked a boat trip for Saturday. The company says the trip will go ahead unless the wind is too strong. If it is cancelled, the group will receive a refund. They have agreed to visit the science museum instead, so the day will not be wasted."},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Запасной план прямо указан: visit the science museum instead; при отмене будет refund."},{"id":"f55f1740-02cc-587d-a633-8289f99cfa56","lesson_id":"0f24909a-f2ba-55ee-b85d-2dec43be12e3","kind":"translation","prompt":"Переведи реальное условие о билете.","position":5,"public_payload":{"source":"Если я найду билет, я тебе позвоню."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["If I find a ticket, I will call you.","If I find a ticket, I'll call you."]},"reference_answer":"If I find a ticket, I will call you.","incorrect_answer":"If I found a ticket, I would call you.","explanation":"Find + will call описывает реальную будущую возможность; found + would меняет тип условия."},{"id":"3ca70ed4-abf8-5a02-a0ae-1a182370160e","lesson_id":"0f24909a-f2ba-55ee-b85d-2dec43be12e3","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Предложи запасной план.","position":6,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"We already went next week."},{"id":"o2","label":"If it cancelled yesterday, we go tomorrow."},{"id":"o3","label":"If it is cancelled, we can go to the cinema."}],"lines":[{"speaker":"Dan","text":"The outdoor concert may be cancelled."},{"speaker":"Lia","text":"What shall we do if that happens?"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"If it is cancelled задаёт реальное условие; can предлагает возможный вариант действий."},{"id":"2fecdb60-3682-50f5-8862-0f1b2ac7c197","lesson_id":"0f24909a-f2ba-55ee-b85d-2dec43be12e3","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь форму после unless.","position":7,"public_payload":{"sentence":"Unless you will leave now, you will be late."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["Unless you leave now, you will be late."]},"reference_answer":"Unless you leave now, you will be late.","incorrect_answer":"Unless you leave now, you will not be late.","explanation":"После unless в таком условии нужен Present Simple. Отрицание в главной части изменило бы смысл."},{"id":"3f113ebd-4876-5eec-8dab-5ad1e25c2cb1","lesson_id":"0f24909a-f2ba-55ee-b85d-2dec43be12e3","kind":"multiple_choice","prompt":"Выбери оба корректных реальных условия.","position":8,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"We will wait unless you call."},{"id":"o2","label":"If I see Maya, I will tell her."},{"id":"o3","label":"If I will see Maya, I will tell her."}]},"answer_key":{"value":["o1","o2"]},"reference_answer":["o2","o1"],"incorrect_answer":["o3"],"explanation":"После if/unless о реальном будущем используем Present Simple, а не will."},{"id":"b16f5792-5a85-5524-90d1-89191ed74a1f","lesson_id":"34070c74-c481-5c27-94f6-d42ea8c572a9","kind":"response_choice","prompt":"Выбери вежливый ответ на запрос коллеги.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"Why you not do it yesterday?"},{"id":"o2","label":"I am a report."},{"id":"o3","label":"Certainly. I will send it this afternoon."}],"context":"Could you send me the updated report, please?"},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Certainly + конкретный срок отвечает на вежливую просьбу по делу."},{"id":"41651201-ace2-5ca7-b7e4-7f6a926c1c43","lesson_id":"34070c74-c481-5c27-94f6-d42ea8c572a9","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь относительное местоимение для человека.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The colleague ___ helped me works in sales."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["who","that"]},"reference_answer":"who","incorrect_answer":"which","explanation":"Who или that может относиться к человеку; which обычно относится к предмету."},{"id":"f11483d5-9b23-5e6d-9971-2a0c1d9881b1","lesson_id":"34070c74-c481-5c27-94f6-d42ea8c572a9","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово о документе в электронном письме.","position":3,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o