 others are delivered to homes. Products that fail the inspection are not used in customer orders."},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Перед cut в тексте стоят inspected and washed."},{"id":"b2744570-5924-502b-a948-9f8110833b02","lesson_id":"95830bb6-49ce-5426-90cf-af879054b2fb","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Объясни, что заказы упаковывают сотрудники.","position":7,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"No, the orders are packed by our staff."},{"id":"o2","label":"No, customers are packing yesterday."},{"id":"o3","label":"Yes, our staff packs every order for them."}],"lines":[{"speaker":"Visitor","text":"Do customers pack the orders themselves?"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o1"},"reference_answer":"o1","incorrect_answer":"o2","explanation":"Отрицательный ответ и passive by our staff согласуются с вопросом."},{"id":"7bd12224-e888-5954-9f11-164be26ef1da","lesson_id":"95830bb6-49ce-5426-90cf-af879054b2fb","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери форму для нескольких писем.","position":8,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"is"},{"id":"o2","label":"are"},{"id":"o3","label":"be"}],"sentence":"All application letters ___ read before interviews are arranged."},"answer_key":{"value":"o2"},"reference_answer":"o2","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"Letters во множественном числе требует are."},{"id":"5859451f-68f4-5630-bd0c-5bbadca7e6fa","lesson_id":"28b596b1-fb0c-5b08-aa2c-309e0fc77921","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери корректный вежливый вопрос.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"Could you tell me where is the station?"},{"id":"o2","label":"Could you tell me where does the station is?"},{"id":"o3","label":"Could you tell me where the station is?"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o3"},"reference_answer":"o3","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"В косвенной части station is, без инверсии."},{"id":"6b7f1427-5886-56b8-91e0-cfada6d46a6f","lesson_id":"28b596b1-fb0c-5b08-aa2