he exit?","explanation":"После introductory phrase используется the exit is."},{"id":"5d21656a-4600-589f-9e4b-a3f07997784a","lesson_id":"28b596b1-fb0c-5b08-aa2c-309e0fc77921","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что Елена выясняет о дневном занятии?","position":6,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"It is full, but she can join a waiting list."},{"id":"o2","label":"It has been cancelled entirely."},{"id":"o3","label":"Registration is no longer needed."}],"passage":"Elena arrives at a conference centre for the first time. Rather than interrupting a speaker, she goes to the information desk. She asks whether the afternoon workshop still has places and where the registration form is. The assistant explains that the workshop is full, but a waiting list is available. Elena asks how she can add her name to it."},"answer_key":{"value":"o1"},"reference_answer":"o1","incorrect_answer":"o2","explanation":"Full означает отсутствие свободных мест, а не отмену."},{"id":"b243c4aa-3869-5210-bc50-e23424e7173a","lesson_id":"28b596b1-fb0c-5b08-aa2c-309e0fc77921","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Вежливо спроси о времени открытия.","position":7,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"Could you tell me what time does the library open?"},{"id":"o2","label":"Could you tell me what time the library opens?"},{"id":"o3","label":"Could you tell me what time opens the library?"}],"lines":[{"speaker":"Visitor","text":"I need some information about the library."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"o2"},"reference_answer":"o2","incorrect_answer":"o1","explanation":"В косвенном вопросе подлежащее стоит перед opens."},{"id":"0270f347-b41d-5587-8de1-5cf733de04b7","lesson_id":"28b596b1-fb0c-5b08-aa2c-309e0fc77921","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери форму в косвенной части.","position":8,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"o1","label":"does take place?"},{"id":"o2","label":"take places"},{"id":"o3","label":"takes place"}],"sentence":"I'd like to know where the meeting ___."},"answer_key":{"value":"o