in the present."},{"id":"vd64de0f2512e","label":"A confirmed event before she rejected the place."},{"id":"vdcf61eb45ca4","label":"A promise about next year."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v7d840ae1237d"},"reference_answer":"v7d840ae1237d","incorrect_answer":"vd64de0f2512e","explanation":"Now указывает на нынешнее знание людей как воображаемый результат прошлого выбора."},{"id":"f039de71-b10a-5772-bfdb-ca14a8fd89e4","lesson_id":"5ebcf706-6786-5ede-956f-069abdd41682","kind":"reading","prompt":"Какой вывод был бы слишком сильным?","position":6,"public_payload":{"passage":"A year ago, Lena turned down a place on an overseas training programme because she wanted to finish a local project. That project has now ended, and she is looking for a new position. She wonders whether accepting the training place would have given her useful contacts. She says, “If I had gone, I would know more people in that field now.” This is a possibility she imagines, not evidence that the programme would certainly have led to a job.","options":[{"id":"vc5211c49c055","label":"Lena rejected the training place a year ago."},{"id":"v7230afe3f189","label":"Her local project has ended."},{"id":"vc234b66025bb","label":"The programme would definitely have secured her a job."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vc234b66025bb"},"reference_answer":"vc234b66025bb","incorrect_answer":"vc5211c49c055","explanation":"Текст прямо отличает возможные контакты от гарантированного трудоустройства."},{"id":"4829556d-267e-5463-b1cb-6de57e161041","lesson_id":"5ebcf706-6786-5ede-956f-069abdd41682","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Свяжи несостоявшееся прошлое обучение с нынешней возможностью.","position":7,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Do you regret not learning to drive earlier?"}],"options":[{"id":"v26f2b2f47e15","label":"Yes. If I had learnt earlier, I could drive us there now."},{"id":"v7ed0adf28aef","label":"Yes. If I learn yesterday, I can drove now."},{"id":"v2c798e4ebb43","label":"Yes. If I had learnt earlier, I drove us yesterday now."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v26f2b2f47e15"},"reference_answer":"v26f2b2f47e15","incorrect_answer":"v7ed0adf28aef","explanation":"Had learnt и could drive now связывают прошлое условие и настоящее умение."},{"id":"71e7842a-7824-59ff-b770-79d7e0792548","lesson_id":"5ebcf706-6786-5ede-956f-069abdd41682","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово, точно соответствующее контексту.","position":8,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The loss of the file was a ___ of not keeping a backup.","options":[{"id":"v4049863164be","label":"precaution"},{"id":"v60c16dba3638","label":"rehearsal"},{"id":"v21da2331d8e3","label":"consequence"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v21da2331d8e3"},"reference_answer":"v21da2331d8e3","incorrect_answer":"v4049863164be","explanation":"Consequence — последствие; precaution — предупреждающая мера."},{"id":"f453ae2f-baa9-5204-b258-d1b319d8c0ce","lesson_id":"59dc13df-e083-5bc6-a786-0ddc9d60a8c7","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: The deadline passed yesterday. I wish I ___ the form sooner.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v7064aefac455","label":"had submitted"},{"id":"v970a0fe0bdd7","label":"submit"},{"id":"v6b66792f7529","label":"will submit"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v7064aefac455"},"reference_answer":"v7064aefac455","incorrect_answer":"v970a0fe0bdd7","explanation":"Завершённое прошлое требует had submitted после wish."},{"id":"f126f16d-6327-5fe6-8cea-59746675dea0","lesson_id":"59dc13df-e083-5bc6-a786-0ddc9d60a8c7","kind":"gap","prompt":"Вставь подходящее слово из пары: read / reading.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"She wishes she had ___ the instructions more carefully."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["read"]},"reference_answer":"read","incorrect_answer":"reading","explanation":"После had требуется причастие read; его написание совпадает с инфинитивом."},{"id":"83b7d992-fa4b-5b63-bd76-92c49e2c14c2","lesson_id":"59dc13df-e083-5bc6-a786-0ddc9d60a8c7","kind":"sentence","prompt":"С