","label":"He overlooked the workshop date."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v19e82dca1ba6"},"reference_answer":"v19e82dca1ba6","incorrect_answer":"vd1c73a96d8b7","explanation":"Он не заметил дату и пришёл на неделю позже."},{"id":"983fead0-aab1-5a84-b676-2b2162c8a34c","lesson_id":"59dc13df-e083-5bc6-a786-0ddc9d60a8c7","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что организатор предложил вместо возврата?","position":6,"public_payload":{"passage":"Noah booked a workshop after reading a short announcement on his phone. He noticed the venue but overlooked the date. When he arrived a week late, the building was closed. He wished he had opened the full booking confirmation instead of relying on the announcement. The organiser offered him a place at a later workshop, but the original fee could not be refunded under the terms he had accepted. Noah decided to add future bookings to his calendar immediately.","options":[{"id":"v9d62178a7edb","label":"A free trip to the original venue."},{"id":"vd03795ae2ae3","label":"A place at a later workshop."},{"id":"v7d22bb172e54","label":"A guaranteed cash refund."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vd03795ae2ae3"},"reference_answer":"vd03795ae2ae3","incorrect_answer":"v7d22bb172e54","explanation":"Предложение касалось другого занятия; возврат исходной суммы был исключён условиями."},{"id":"689d695d-2e71-5907-a131-4c009ffa08ea","lesson_id":"59dc13df-e083-5bc6-a786-0ddc9d60a8c7","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Вырази сожаление о непроверенном расписании.","position":7,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"I missed the last bus because I did not check the timetable."}],"options":[{"id":"v495585c3ef95","label":"I wish I check it yesterday."},{"id":"v4c207d9f963c","label":"I wish I will checked it."},{"id":"v35718f8dfaac","label":"I wish I had checked it before leaving."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v35718f8dfaac"},"reference_answer":"v35718f8dfaac","incorrect_answer":"v495585c3ef95","explanation":"Wish I had checked относится к конкретному несостоявшемуся 