,"t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t1"],"explanation":"Will have my bicycle serviced не означает, что говорящий сам выполнит обслуживание."},{"id":"fad02732-87cc-5508-ab6d-ca61fcab09fb","lesson_id":"f80cc913-eb26-5bee-a633-7d5095d1ba83","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь только ошибку в конструкции, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"She had her watch repair at the shop."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["She had her watch repaired at the shop."]},"reference_answer":"She had her watch repaired at the shop.","incorrect_answer":"She had her watch repair at the shop.","explanation":"После her watch нужно repaired — причастие результата услуги."},{"id":"bb10890a-1974-5994-aff7-59b78e41bf58","lesson_id":"f80cc913-eb26-5bee-a633-7d5095d1ba83","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что сделали с цепью?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"Before a long cycling trip, Eva took her bicycle to a repair shop. She had the brakes checked and the chain replaced. The mechanic said that the tyres were still in good condition, so replacing them was unnecessary. Eva had expected a larger bill and appreciated the explanation. She kept the receipt in case a problem appeared during the shop’s warranty period. The visit prepared the bicycle for the journey, although it could not remove every possible risk on the road.","options":[{"id":"vac8dafaea686","label":"The shop replaced it."},{"id":"v725cf760283f","label":"Eva checked it but kept the old one."},{"id":"v071bdc819806","label":"The mechanic replaced the tyres instead."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vac8dafaea686"},"reference_answer":"vac8dafaea686","incorrect_answer":"v725cf760283f","explanation":"The chain replaced в конструкции had the chain replaced сообщает о замене цепи."},{"id":"9a04adb4-8ff7-558c-b662-2b2a1b1b1341","lesson_id":"f80cc913-eb26-5bee-a633-7d5095d1ba83"