later."},{"id":"v5c730d8f8f0c","label":"In order participants could to check later."},{"id":"vdd3de226eeea","label":"Because of participants to checking later."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vba20300b918e"},"reference_answer":"vba20300b918e","incorrect_answer":"v5c730d8f8f0c","explanation":"So that participants could ... — полноценная целевая часть."},{"id":"29fe9e6b-b7f0-5529-8baa-ab8c20ffee49","lesson_id":"a5125231-2b9a-5d47-b10e-072407923bed","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"Making the doorway easier to use improves ___ to the room.","options":[{"id":"v6d3d3135ece0","label":"purpose"},{"id":"vac806c0ca08c","label":"ownership"},{"id":"v63de34b20f11","label":"access"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v63de34b20f11"},"reference_answer":"v63de34b20f11","incorrect_answer":"v6d3d3135ece0","explanation":"Access — возможность попасть в помещение или пользоваться им."},{"id":"c652212a-d8a3-5ab5-b891-3acf54b87dad","lesson_id":"a807f97e-7989-5280-b776-816f3a7265c3","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: The student ___ coat was missing came to reception.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v7b69d7cdb909","label":"whose"},{"id":"vb62a33d6f681","label":"who’s"},{"id":"v77c8d06ebf05","label":"who"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v7b69d7cdb909"},"reference_answer":"v7b69d7cdb909","incorrect_answer":"vb62a33d6f681","explanation":"Перед coat нужно притяжательное whose."},{"id":"cd7ebcd0-6e42-5c51-ad33-7fb7d4cbe342","lesson_id":"a807f97e-7989-5280-b776-816f3a7265c3","kind":"gap","prompt":"Дополни предложение словом из пары: whose / who.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"I spoke to the visitor ___ phone we had found."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["whose"]},"reference_answer":"whose","incorrect_answer":"who","explanation":"Whose phone связывает посетителя с принадлежащим ему телефоном."},{"id":"14fdc7cd-2d08-599f-955f-ca2d2bd8f5ba","lesson_id":"a807f97e-7989-5280-b776-816f3a7265c3","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Женщина, чью сумку мы нашли, поблагодарила нас.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"whose"},{"id":"t4","label":"bag"},{"id":"t5","label":"we"},{"id":"t6","label":"found"},{"id":"t7","label":"thanked"},{"id":"t8","label":"us."},{"id":"t1","label":"The"},{"id":"t2","label":"woman"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t1"],"explanation":"Whose bag обозначает сумку этой женщины."},{"id":"6c3f44e2-cb94-52dd-98b2-2019a1a30c7a","lesson_id":"a807f97e-7989-5280-b776-816f3a7265c3","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь указанную конструкцию, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The boy who’s bicycle was damaged called the shop."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["The boy whose bicycle was damaged called the shop."]},"reference_answer":"The boy whose bicycle was damaged called the shop.","incorrect_answer":"The boy who’s bicycle was damaged called the shop.","explanation":"Перед bicycle нужна форма whose, а не who is/who has."},{"id":"8d5bdb85-f8c3-5c1c-80bf-f0ce0ec35160","lesson_id":"a807f97e-7989-5280-b776-816f3a7265c3","kind":"reading","prompt":"Какое изображение помогло найти возможного владельца?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"A volunteer found a backpack after a sports event. There was no name label, but a photograph inside showed a red bicycle. The volunteer remembered a visitor whose bicycle had been parked by the entrance. Rather than hand over the bag immediately, she asked him to describe its contents. His description matched, and he collected the backpack.","options":[{"id":"v4d1d52c510f6","label":"A train timetable."},{"id":"v254e8f091d64","label":"A photograph of the volunteer."},{"id":"v941ef9775e18","label":"A red bicycle."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v941ef9775e18"},"reference_answer":"v941ef9775e18","incorrect_answer":"v4d1d52c510f6","explanation":"Фотография велосипеда связала сумку с замеченным посетителем."},{"id":"2aa84e04-1118-5686-9d37-dc88be561ae3","lesson_id":"a807f97e-7989-5280-b776-816f3a7265c3","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова урока с переводом в указанном контексте.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l913b2e1c682c","label":"owner"},{"id":"la785164192e9","label":"belong"},{"id":"l30a378ecee90","label":"label"},{"id":"l460260de2729","label":"identify"}],"right":[{"id":"r9c2d74ec9cdb","label":"бирка"},{"id":"rc3e274fbf857","label":"опознавать"},{"id":"rcd51fdd246b7","label":"владелец"},{"id":"rc3d6525f32da","label":"принадлежать"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"l913b2e1c682c":"rcd51fdd246b7","la785164192e9":"rc3d6525f32da","l30a378ecee90":"r9c2d74ec9cdb","l460260de2729":"rc3e274fbf857"}},"reference_answer":{"l913b2e1c682c":"rcd51fdd246b7","la785164192e9":"rc3d6525f32da","l30a378ecee90":"r9c2d74ec9cdb","l460260de2729":"rc3e274fbf857"},"incorrect_answer":{"l913b2e1c682c":"rc3d6525f32da","la785164192e9":"rcd51fdd246b7","l30a378ecee90":"r9c2d74ec9cdb","l460260de2729":"rc3e274fbf857"},"explanation":"В этих контекстах: owner — владелец; belong — принадлежать; label — бирка; identify — опознавать."},{"id":"13345821-1fe4-55cd-8b3d-2461a88270eb","lesson_id":"a807f97e-7989-5280-b776-816f3a7265c3","kind":"reading","prompt":"Почему сумку не отдали сразу?","position":7,"public_payload":{"passage":"A volunteer found a backpack after a sports event. There was no name label, but a photograph inside showed a red bicycle. The volunteer remembered a visitor whose bicycle had been parked by the entrance. Rather than hand over the bag immediately, she asked him to describe its contents. His description matched, and he collected the backpack.","options":[{"id":"va8bf28903e8a","label":"Every bag at the event belonged to the same person."},{"id":"vbbd7c32e4129","label":"The volunteer checked whether he could describe what was inside."},{"id":"v3314bd504ec6","label":"The volunteer wanted to keep it permanently."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vbbd7c32e4129"},"reference_answer":"vbbd7c32e4129","incorrect_answer":"v3314bd504ec6","explanation":"Описание содержимого стало дополнительной проверкой принадлежности."},{"id":"e02b5aac-7ac2-5708-ac49-70c47632fdf7","lesson_id":"a807f97e-7989-5280-b776-816f3a7265c3","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Укажи человека по имени на бирке.","position":8,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Which visitor should we contact about the missing hat?"}],"options":[{"id":"v216c7bd3afa6","label":"The visitor who’s name is on the label."},{"id":"v376090a45be7","label":"The visitor which name is on the label."},{"id":"v97747a80a0ed","label":"The visitor whose name is on the label."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v97747a80a0ed"},"reference_answer":"v97747a80a0ed","incorrect_answer":"v216c7bd3afa6","explanation":"Whose name передаёт принадлежность имени посетителю."},{"id":"5ab9f7d9-7a17-5409-a430-3255443a20f0","lesson_id":"a807f97e-7989-5280-b776-816f3a7265c3","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The person to whom the bag belongs is its ___.","options":[{"id":"v9bd2e4e2362f","label":"entrance"},{"id":"vc55c602a568e","label":"owner"},{"id":"vdf75ec60a2e0","label":"label"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vc55c602a568e"},"reference_answer":"vc55c602a568e","incorrect_answer":"vdf75ec60a2e0","explanation":"Owner обозначает владельца, а не деталь сумки или место."},{"id":"081ac7d2-87ef-5b7c-876e-09b97a4760c6","lesson_id":"8740560e-5a87-5339-bdec-8725713e0053","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: Yesterday, Sara said, “I am tired.” При пересказе со сдвигом времени: Sara said that she ___ tired.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"vd6d514670a8f","label":"am"},{"id":"vbf32158a6c9e","label":"were"},{"id":"vf380dfce72fa","label":"was"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vf380dfce72fa"},"reference_answer":"vf380dfce72fa","incorrect_answer":"vd6d514670a8f","explanation":"Для she и сдвига am в прошлое используется was."},{"id":"eaf54951-34d9-59a9-a6dc-afc0470f27ab","lesson_id":"8740560e-5a87-5339-bdec-8725713e0053","kind":"gap","prompt":"Дополни предложение словом из пары: said / told.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"He ___ me that the room was available."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["told"]},"reference_answer":"told","incorrect_answer":"said","explanation":"Перед me без to нужен told."},{"id":"cddc3946-1383-52ad-a571-bc1875341289","lesson_id":"8740560e-5a87-5339-bdec-8725713e0053","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Она сказала нам, что встреча отменена.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"us"},{"id":"t4","label":"that"},{"id":"t5","label":"the"},{"id":"t6","label":"meeting"},{"id":"t7","label":"was"},{"id":"t8","label":"cancelled."},{"id":"t1","label":"She"},{"id":"t2","label":"told"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t1"],"explanation":"Told принимает адресата us; сообщение передаётся через that."},{"id":"0369e208-c6f2-5b55-a1c6-ab8856e0a61e","lesson_id":"8740560e-5a87-5339-bdec-8725713e0053","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь указанную конструкцию, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The organiser said me that the room was closed."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["The organiser told me that the room was closed."]},"reference_answer":"The organiser told me that the room was closed.","incorrect_answer":"The organiser said me that the room was closed.","explanation":"В задании сохраняем me без предлога и заменяем said на told."},{"id":"b0c53aff-6df6-5e78-9c3e-404f4825b93d","lesson_id":"8740560e-5a87-5339-bdec-8725713e0053","kind":"reading","prompt":"Почему Сара не пришла на встречу?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"On Monday, I asked Sara whether she could join our planning meeting that afternoon. She said that she was tired after travelling and wanted to rest. I told the organiser that Sara would not attend. The next morning, Sara emailed a written suggestion, so the group could still consider her idea even though she had missed the discussion.","options":[{"id":"v2bad312637d4","label":"She had no ideas about the project."},{"id":"v76bc1003fa02","label":"She was tired after travelling and wanted to rest."},{"id":"v8e236e6fbfb9","label":"The organiser had refused to invite her."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v76bc1003fa02"},"reference_answer":"v76bc1003fa02","incorrect_answer":"v8e236e6fbfb9","explanation":"Её причина передана через said that; отказа в приглашении нет."},{"id":"865acf9f-109b-567a-a4a4-8765207c6247","lesson_id":"8740560e-5a87-5339-bdec-8725713e0053","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова урока с переводом в указанном контексте.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l14cfa40f02d4","label":"message"},{"id":"l19f68f47dd45","label":"explain"},{"id":"l81784ad8a69f","label":"confirm"},{"id":"l820a0fc507e8","label":"available"}],"right":[{"id":"r9bf4282369b3","label":"подтверждать"},{"id":"r471902358c2c","label":"свободный, доступный"},{"id":"r538520b527a3","label":"сообщение"},{"id":"r5f33b85e61f4","label":"объяснять"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"l14cfa40f02d4":"r538520b527a3","l19f68f47dd45":"r5f33b85e61f4","l81784ad8a69f":"r9bf4282369b3","l820a0fc507e8":"r471902358c2c"}},"reference_answer":{"l14cfa40f02d4":"r538520b527a3","l19f68f47dd45":"r5f33b85e61f4","l81784ad8a69f":"r9bf4282369b3","l820a0fc507e8":"r471902358c2c"},"incorrect_answer":{"l14cfa40f02d4":"r5f33b85e61f4","l19f68f47dd45":"r538520b527a3","l81784ad8a69f":"r9bf4282369b3","l820a0fc507e8":"r471902358c2c"},"explanation":"В этих контекстах: message — сообщение; explain — объяснять; confirm — подтверждать; available — свободный, доступный."},{"id":"334d1e1f-5273-508c-9e32-bf9196417e60","lesson_id":"8740560e-5a87-5339-bdec-8725713e0053","kind":"reading","prompt":"Как её идея попала в обсуждение группы?","position":7,"public_payload":{"passage":"On Monday, I asked Sara whether she could join our planning meeting that afternoon. She said that she was tired after travelling and wanted to rest. I told the organiser that Sara would not attend. The next morning, Sara emailed a written suggestion, so the group could still consider her idea even though she had missed the discussion.","options":[{"id":"v9141a36ce59b","label":"She sent a written suggestion the next morning."},{"id":"vb938314e47e9","label":"She attended the entire Monday meeting."},{"id":"v3c261f38c60c","label":"The organiser invented a suggestion in her name."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v9141a36ce59b"},"reference_answer":"v9141a36ce59b","incorrect_answer":"vb938314e47e9","explanation":"Сара отправила письменное предложение уже после пропущенной встречи."},{"id":"fad62f1e-1c46-5d63-ae75-5e179196fe6c","lesson_id":"8740560e-5a87-5339-bdec-8725713e0053","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Сохрани адресата me без предлога.","position":8,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"How can I report his message without changing “me” to “to me”?"}],"options":[{"id":"v9e5ece3d126d","label":"He told that me the train delayed."},{"id":"v48afcb0ed55e","label":"He told me that the train was delayed."},{"id":"v751606c54a48","label":"He said me that the train was delayed."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v48afcb0ed55e"},"reference_answer":"v48afcb0ed55e","incorrect_answer":"v751606c54a48","explanation":"Told me — нужная модель; said потребовало бы to me."},{"id":"3674f378-e7db-5ee4-8673-11f229914189","lesson_id":"8740560e-5a87-5339-bdec-8725713e0053","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"To make an arrangement definite is to ___ it.","options":[{"id":"v92c84081001a","label":"confirm"},{"id":"va3744d1a001a","label":"cancel automatically"},{"id":"v71518e3800d1","label":"overlook"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v92c84081001a"},"reference_answer":"v92c84081001a","incorrect_answer":"va3744d1a001a","explanation":"Confirm — подтвердить, а не отменить или забыть."},{"id":"ea37e3d5-a411-5b4f-919a-9b218c586905","lesson_id":"088ecd6c-a617-522d-b632-0cfff973fe60","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: It was ___ an unexpected delay that we missed the introduction.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v67ec9a61bb0f","label":"too of"},{"id":"vbc109bd067ec","label":"such"},{"id":"v25bedc0f3593","label":"so"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vbc109bd067ec"},"reference_answer":"vbc109bd067ec","incorrect_answer":"v25bedc0f3593","explanation":"Перед an unexpected delay используется such."},{"id":"4d4fdd59-31da-5778-beba-f9e7f6401207","lesson_id":"088ecd6c-a617-522d-b632-0cfff973fe60","kind":"gap","prompt":"Дополни предложение словом из пары: so / such.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The room was ___ noisy that we could not hear the speaker."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["so"]},"reference_answer":"so","incorrect_answer":"such","explanation":"Перед прилагательным noisy без существительного нужен so."},{"id":"bda277b9-7b63-5f37-aaed-f3d38e0cdfd9","lesson_id":"088ecd6c-a617-522d-b632-0cfff973fe60","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Это было такое полезное обсуждение, что мы остались дольше.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"such"},{"id":"t4","label":"a"},{"id":"t5","label":"useful"},{"id":"t6","label":"discussion"},{"id":"t7","label":"that"},{"id":"t8","label":"we"},{"id":"t9","label":"stayed"},{"id":"t10","label":"longer."},{"id":"t1","label":"It"},{"id":"t2","label":"was"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10","t1"],"explanation":"Such относится ко всей группе a useful discussion."},{"id":"75922339-5289-53