paired in June."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["The roof was repaired in June."]},"reference_answer":"The roof was repaired in June.","incorrect_answer":"The roof were repaired in June.","explanation":"The roof — единственное число, поэтому was."},{"id":"eea44f48-1fe1-54cb-9be3-36a1120adfcb","lesson_id":"f59a4489-5123-53b3-9934-326e9c91c6fc","kind":"reading","prompt":"Когда заменили окна?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"The neighbourhood hall reopened in September after several months of work. The roof was repaired in June, and the windows were replaced in July. Local students painted a mural in the entrance. Most of the repair costs were covered by a grant, while volunteers helped with cleaning. The reopening notice thanked both the funders and the people who gave their time.","options":[{"id":"v389322d5470b","label":"In July."},{"id":"v8fef883534df","label":"In June."},{"id":"v04874babb509","label":"In September after reopening."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v389322d5470b"},"reference_answer":"v389322d5470b","incorrect_answer":"v8fef883534df","explanation":"June относится к крыше, July — к окнам."},{"id":"70b6ca65-a9c0-52bb-9a10-6f384b2f1959","lesson_id":"f59a4489-5123-53b3-9934-326e9c91c6fc","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова урока с переводом в указанном контексте.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l5bd9c6cb37c6","label":"restore"},{"id":"l5b7046a51951","label":"replace"},{"id":"l77762395355e","label":"mural"},{"id":"lb3b639e5d93f","label":"volunteer"}],"right":[{"id":"r5a98de168dc2","label":"настенная роспись"},{"id":"r7bfb8e3c229c","label":"волонтёр"},{"id":"r4d55369a6198","label":"восстанавливать"},{"id":"r8ce9c3f5e57b","label":"заменять"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"l5bd9c6cb37c6":"r4d55369a6198","l5b7046a51951":"r8ce9c3f5e57b","l77762395355e":"r5a98de168dc2","lb3b639e5d93f":"r7bfb8e3c229c"}},"reference_answer":{"l5bd9c6cb37c6":"r4d55369a6198","l5b7046a51951":"r8ce9c3f5e57b","l77762395355e":"r5a98de168dc2","lb3b639e5d93f":"r7bfb8e3c229