":"the"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10","t1"],"explanation":"Neither ... nor отрицает обе альтернативы; комнаты названы в единственном числе."},{"id":"07e03f4e-f78d-5734-8e6f-e4740c3dd198","lesson_id":"360ecec7-b3f5-54c2-b268-a567dbfc0247","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь указанную конструкцию, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"We can use either the library nor the meeting room."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["We can use either the library or the meeting room."]},"reference_answer":"We can use either the library or the meeting room.","incorrect_answer":"We can use either the library nor the meeting room.","explanation":"После either нужен or; nor используется с neither."},{"id":"0e915c7a-f433-5d8d-a277-8a781a518217","lesson_id":"360ecec7-b3f5-54c2-b268-a567dbfc0247","kind":"reading","prompt":"Какие варианты предложили вместо среды?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"The language club wanted to meet on Wednesday. Neither the library nor the meeting room was available that evening. The coordinator offered two alternatives: Tuesday in the library or Thursday in the meeting room. Members chose Thursday because more people could attend. The decision concerned this week only; the usual Wednesday time was not permanently changed.","options":[{"id":"vf6b71ed53668","label":"Wednesday in either room."},{"id":"v3c6a43064a5c","label":"Every evening in both rooms."},{"id":"v0afb431d4319","label":"Tuesday in the library or Thursday in the meeting room."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v0afb431d4319"},"reference_answer":"v0afb431d4319","incorrect_answer":"vf6b71ed53668","explanation":"Оба предложенных сочетания дня и места названы явно."},{"id":"176f48df-c62d-58c2-840e-b3b094aa85dc","lesson_id":"360ecec7-b3f5-54c2-b268-a567dbfc0247","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова урока с переводом в указанном контексте.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l0d3b3483d72a","label":"alternative"},{"id":"l2bd743626ba4","label":"option"},{"id":"lb7b5b3921bbd","label":"available"},{"id":"l4a690a40f833","label":"suitable"}],"right":[{"id":"r34186dbac40c","label":"доступный"},{"id":"r460b367bdc28","label":"подходящий"},{"id":"rc7d42feeece7","label":"альтернативный вариант"},{"id":"rd513f3503f47","label":"вариант"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"l0d3b3483d72a":"rc7d42feeece7","l2bd743626ba4":"rd513f3503f47","lb7b5b3921bbd":"r34186dbac40c","l4a690a40f833":"r460b367bdc28"}},"reference_answer":{"l0d3b3483d72a":"rc7d42feeece7","l2bd743626ba4":"rd513f3503f47","lb7b5b3921bbd":"r34186dbac40c","l4a690a40f833":"r460b367bdc28"},"incorrect_answer":{"l0d3b3483d72a":"rd513f3503f47","l2bd743626ba4":"rc7d42feeece7","lb7b5b3921bbd":"r34186dbac40c","l4a690a40f833":"r460b367bdc28"},"explanation":"В этих контекстах: alternative — альтернативный вариант; option — вариант; available — доступный; suitable — подходящий."},{"id":"bf39131c-a959-569d-80f3-b87bae3d1066","lesson_id":"360ecec7-b3f5-54c2-b268-a567dbfc0247","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что известно об обычном расписании?","position":7,"public_payload":{"passage":"The language club wanted to meet on Wednesday. Neither the library nor the meeting room was available that evening. The coordinator offered two alternatives: Tuesday in the library or Thursday in the meeting room. Members chose Thursday because more people could attend. The decision concerned this week only; the usual Wednesday time was not permanently changed.","options":[{"id":"v8cce5938edee","label":"The club cancelled all Wednesday meetings forever."},{"id":"v39e71f3a0f34","label":"The Wednesday time was not permanently changed."},{"id":"vf9a7c83f3468","label":"Every future meeting will be on Thursday."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v39e71f3a0f34"},"reference_answer":"v39e71f3a0f34","incorrect_answer":"vf9a7c83f3468","explanation":"В конце уточнено, что решение касается только текущей недели."},{"id":"2f76602a-e61a-594b-b894-ff56950c5087","lesson_id":"360ecec7-b3f5-54c2-b268-a567dbfc0247","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Скажи, что подходит любой из двух вариантов.","position":8,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Would you prefer the morning or the afternoon?"}],"options":[{"id":"v2a127a966ee9","label":"Neither time are suitable but both are suitable."},{"id":"v73c604ed7b57","label":"Either time nor suitable."},{"id":"v3d9449e65990","label":"Either time is suitable for me."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v3d9449e65990"},"reference_answer":"v3d9449e65990","incorrect_answer":"v2a127a966ee9","explanation":"Either time с is описывает приемлемость любой одной альтернативы."},{"id":"1f510c3b-0fe4-5ef9-ba91-b012d201edfd","lesson_id":"360ecec7-b3f5-54c2-b268-a567dbfc0247","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"A different possible course of action is an ___.","options":[{"id":"v2a094e91924a","label":"obligation in every case"},{"id":"v170c7b6d8769","label":"alternative"},{"id":"vb920e685ef56","label":"identical copy only"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v170c7b6d8769"},"reference_answer":"v170c7b6d8769","incorrect_answer":"vb920e685ef56","explanation":"Alternative — другой доступный вариант, не обязательно обязательство."},{"id":"5fe471c4-6475-5a13-940f-bfdee94e436f","lesson_id":"a8287a82-e0b8-59c6-9f54-32ea9b4bc5e3","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: The lights are on, but I am not sure anyone is inside. Someone ___ there.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"vfb3f6c305859","label":"might is"},{"id":"v10483d4622c6","label":"might being"},{"id":"vf03a5b8bbd71","label":"might be"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vf03a5b8bbd71"},"reference_answer":"vf03a5b8bbd71","incorrect_answer":"vfb3f6c305859","explanation":"После might нужен be; неопределённость явно указана в контексте."},{"id":"d048c7ab-