 useful clue, but it did not show which person was there or why.","options":[{"id":"v174ef08fdde4","label":"The office had no electricity."},{"id":"v33196362188e","label":"Someone might still be working."},{"id":"vb870f9ccc05a","label":"Every colleague was definitely in a meeting."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v33196362188e"},"reference_answer":"v33196362188e","incorrect_answer":"vb870f9ccc05a","explanation":"Свет поддерживал возможность присутствия, но не определял человека."},{"id":"dc44929f-3a81-5ce7-93e1-7287dad9bfef","lesson_id":"a8287a82-e0b8-59c6-9f54-32ea9b4bc5e3","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова урока с переводом в указанном контексте.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l523aa5aa93d6","label":"clue"},{"id":"l585251a6c9f3","label":"possible"},{"id":"l5b33e87c9ae7","label":"certain"},{"id":"l58d13d5ba9c2","label":"check"}],"right":[{"id":"r275f86f868a7","label":"уверенный"},{"id":"rfd5ee17e041a","label":"проверять"},{"id":"r07f5ca2d7113","label":"подсказка, признак"},{"id":"r93b816181748","label":"возможный"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"l523aa5aa93d6":"r07f5ca2d7113","l585251a6c9f3":"r93b816181748","l5b33e87c9ae7":"r275f86f868a7","l58d13d5ba9c2":"rfd5ee17e041a"}},"reference_answer":{"l523aa5aa93d6":"r07f5ca2d7113","l585251a6c9f3":"r93b816181748","l5b33e87c9ae7":"r275f86f868a7","l58d13d5ba9c2":"rfd5ee17e041a"},"incorrect_answer":{"l523aa5aa93d6":"r93b816181748","l585251a6c9f3":"r07f5ca2d7113","l5b33e87c9ae7":"r275f86f868a7","l58d13d5ba9c2":"rfd5ee17e041a"},"explanation":"В этих контекстах: clue — подсказка, признак; possible — возможный; certain — уверенный; check — проверять."},{"id":"d1b9a6a8-5a2e-578a-804b-72cb0858614c","lesson_id":"a8287a82-e0b8-59c6-9f54-32ea9b4bc5e3","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что выяснилось после звонка?","position":7,"public_payload":{"passage":"The office lights were on when Maya arrived, so she thought someone might still be working. She called before opening the door. A colleague answered and explained that a cleaner was inside, while the rest of the team had left. The light was a useful clue, but it did not show which person was there or why.","options":[{"id":"ved412075e5de","label":"A cleaner was inside."},{"id":"vdbdd1eb6ab4b","label":"The entire team was still at work."},{"id":"v9b2c9954a2df","label":"Nobody had left the office."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"ved412075e5de"},"reference_answer":"ved412075e5de","incorrect_answer":"vdbdd1eb6ab4b","explanation":"Звонок уточнил объяснение; остальные сотрудники уже ушли."},{"id":"0fdcf231-6319-5e0a-9f0e-93656ff03153","lesson_id":"a8287a82-e0b8-59c6-9f54-32ea9b4bc5e3","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Предложи возможное местонахождение без ложной уверенности.","position":8,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Do you know where Alex is?"}],"options":[{"id":"v1dc2933021a4","label":"He might upstairs be is."},{"id":"v96d035b0aadc","label":"He might be upstairs, but I have not checked."},{"id":"v2b59034b9d8c","label":"He might is upstairs, but I have not checked."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v96d035b0aadc"},"reference_answer":"v96d035b0aadc","incorrect_answer":"v2b59034b9d8c","explanation":"Might be и оговорка о проверке сохраняют неопределённость."},{"id":"25a4b833-9570-5eed-a243-ad5b7ac00f48","lesson_id":"a8287a82-e0b8-59c6-9f54-32ea9b4bc5e3","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"A piece of information that helps you work something out is a ___.","options":[{"id":"v417ac4e1560b","label":"clue"},{"id":"v08dcddf2fdb1","label":"guarantee in every case"},{"id":"v1dbd241fce1b","label":"verdict by definition"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v417ac4e1560b"},"reference_answer":"v417ac4e1560b","incorrect_answer":"v08dcddf2fdb1","explanation":"Clue помогает выводу, но сам по себе не равен гарантии или окончательному решению."},{"id":"19320ccc-da99-532c-b8de-2551f9787c11","lesson_id":"b6e6511b-ad3c-5c81-b46c-b96ff005cc87","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точн