rning вместо to learn."},{"id":"fb246837-e672-5e68-9888-39f1283003f9","lesson_id":"b6e6511b-ad3c-5c81-b46c-b96ff005cc87","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что Элла проверила перед подачей заявки?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"Ella was interested in joining a photography club. Before applying, she read the requirements and checked whether beginners were welcome. The club asked members to bring a camera, but borrowing one was allowed. Ella contacted a friend rather than buying equipment immediately. She completed the application after confirming that she could borrow a camera for the first month.","options":[{"id":"v10d0601820b5","label":"Whether beginners were welcome."},{"id":"v9eb8c4577a8f","label":"Whether she could skip every requirement."},{"id":"v3f456d1b565b","label":"Whether the club sold only expensive cameras."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v10d0601820b5"},"reference_answer":"v10d0601820b5","incorrect_answer":"v9eb8c4577a8f","explanation":"В первом шаге она выяснила, принимают ли начинающих."},{"id":"68992ec7-d3f6-5276-9a5f-df7d2232c994","lesson_id":"b6e6511b-ad3c-5c81-b46c-b96ff005cc87","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова урока с переводом в указанном контексте.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l617887e22cd3","label":"join"},{"id":"l63ce81d2426a","label":"interested"},{"id":"l1153ca11a744","label":"application"},{"id":"lb206264fbb62","label":"requirement"}],"right":[{"id":"rbee193d0a674","label":"заявка"},{"id":"r54cd584b9a14","label":"требование"},{"id":"r0c2e60a8e01b","label":"присоединяться"},{"id":"r0c1f4b18bd53","label":"заинтересованный"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"l617887e22cd3":"r0c2e60a8e01b","l63ce81d2426a":"r0c1f4b18bd53","l1153ca11a744":"rbee193d0a674","lb206264fbb62":"r54cd584b9a14"}},"reference_answer":{"l617887e22cd3":"r0c2e60a8e01b","l63ce81d2426a":"r0c1f4b18bd53","l1153ca11a744":"rbee193d0a674","lb206264fbb62":"r54cd584b9a14"},"incorrect_answer":{"l617887e22cd3":"r0c1f4b18bd53","l63ce81d2426a":"r0c2e60a8e01b","l1153ca1