вает факт отправки, не доказывая доставку."},{"id":"c52d3c0f-2ade-5682-b93e-afd1e58b4cd0","lesson_id":"43da37d8-8356-5ec2-9ce9-2b0a0a423662","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь указанную конструкцию, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"I did sent the attachment with the email."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["I did send the attachment with the email."]},"reference_answer":"I did send the attachment with the email.","incorrect_answer":"I did sent the attachment with the email.","explanation":"После did используется send без прошедшего окончания."},{"id":"7312aa17-c235-5a31-956c-8ab073be8c02","lesson_id":"43da37d8-8356-5ec2-9ce9-2b0a0a423662","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что подчёркивает студент с did send?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"A student complained that an application had not been processed. The administrator replied that no form had arrived. “I did send it on Monday,” the student said, showing a saved message. The message supported the fact that he had attempted to send the form, but the address contained a spelling error. The administrator explained the difference between sending to an address and successful delivery to the correct office. They corrected the address together and agreed on how to confirm receipt.","options":[{"id":"v3147be012a7b","label":"That no address was needed."},{"id":"v965e4969e2d9","label":"That he sent the message rather than forgot to send it."},{"id":"v695e8a9e84eb","label":"That the correct office necessarily received it."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v965e4969e2d9"},"reference_answer":"v965e4969e2d9","incorrect_answer":"v695e8a9e84eb","explanation":"Усиление относится к действию отправки, не автоматически к успешному получению."},{"id":"386723b3-24f8-5129-a48e-157c0217916d","lesson_id":"43da37d8-8356-5ec2-9ce9-2b0a0a423662","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова урока с переводом в указанном контексте.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l487f06a075be","label":"emphasis"},{"id":"l8295b8899ac7","label":"acknowledge"},{"id":"ld275582af79b","label":"misunderstanding"},{"id":"ld51a030473ab","label":"dispute"}],"right":[{"id":"red9930e3e967","label":"недоразумение"},{"id":"rbee22d6a6f2c","label":"оспаривать"},{"id":"r103d9026b9b9","label":"усиление"},{"id":"raffc7f4fd2fe","label":"признавать, подтверждать"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"l487f06a075be":"r103d9026b9b9","l8295b8899ac7":"raffc7f4fd2fe","ld275582af79b":"red9930e3e967","ld51a030473ab":"rbee22d6a6f2c"}},"reference_answer":{"l487f06a075be":"r103d9026b9b9","l8295b8899ac7":"raffc7f4fd2fe","ld275582af79b":"red9930e3e967","ld51a030473ab":"rbee22d6a6f2c"},"incorrect_answer":{"l487f06a075be":"raffc7f4fd2fe","l8295b8899ac7":"r103d9026b9b9","ld275582af79b":"red9930e3e967","ld51a030473ab":"rbee22d6a6f2c"},"explanation":"В этих контекстах: emphasis — усиление; acknowledge — признавать, подтверждать; misunderstanding — недоразумение; dispute — оспаривать."},{"id":"19fdba4d-ea23-5629-b2fd-cddec58cbbce","lesson_id":"43da37d8-8356-5ec2-9ce9-2b0a0a423662","kind":"reading","prompt":"Что объяснило отсутствие формы в офисе?","position":7,"public_payload":{"passage":"A student complained that an application had not been processed. The administrator replied that no form had arrived. “I did send it on Monday,” the student said, showing a saved message. The message supported the fact that he had attempted to send the form, but the address contained a spelling error. The administrator explained the difference between sending to an address and successful delivery to the correct office. They corrected the address together and agreed on how to confirm receipt.","options":[{"id":"v1fa82ea6c03b","label":"The email address contained a spelling error."},{"id":"v073553643706","label":"The administrator had deleted every application."},{"id":"v821bb1cd5c5b","label":"The student had never attempted to send anything."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v1fa82ea6c03b"},"reference_answer":"v1fa82ea6c03b","incorrect_answer":"v073553643706","explanation":"Сохранённое сообщение и ошибка адреса объясняют различие между отправкой и доставкой."},{"id":"2083fec0-07a6-5144-b50e-6ae383ddfa62","lesson_id":"43da37d8-8356-5ec2-9ce9-2b0a0a423662","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Подчеркни понимание, не утверждая согласие с решением.","position":8,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Do you understand the concern at all?"}],"options":[{"id":"v1b375ce3654e","label":"I am do understand it yesterday."},{"id":"v79a291267a8f","label":"I do understand it; I disagree about the proposed solution."},{"id":"v9e77258077a1","label":"I do understands it; I disagree about the solution."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v79a291267a8f"},"reference_answer":"v79a291267a8f","incorrect_answer":"v9e77258077a1","explanation":"Do understand усиливает утверждение, а последующая часть сохраняет несогласие."},{"id":"7483e61a-04fa-5e00-96c2-6a33152c9c03","lesson_id":"43da37d8-8356-5ec2-9ce9-2b0a0a423662","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"To confirm that a message has been received is to ___ receipt.","options":[{"id":"v6185fbe50eac","label":"acknowledge"},{"id":"v8c645c4b16e7","label":"dispute every"},{"id":"ve5c8e7bc8903","label":"predict"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v6185fbe50eac"},"reference_answer":"v6185fbe50eac","incorrect_answer":"v8c645c4b16e7","explanation":"Acknowledge receipt — подтвердить получение."},{"id":"a65d1cc9-1f99-58d3-8489-a446674e2917","lesson_id":"0bd5c454-ddf0-5544-83e0-b2d4c7da9e2f","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: You may borrow the equipment provided that you ___ it by Friday.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v0e71d79bf3c1","label":"returned yesterday"},{"id":"va57af31425f7","label":"return"},{"id":"v7f961ca20093","label":"will returning"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"va57af31425f7"},"reference_answer":"va57af31425f7","incorrect_answer":"v7f961ca20093","explanation":"В таком будущем условии используется return."},{"id":"d85e7e64-b323-5e13-8015-92dc17494310","lesson_id":"0bd5c454-ddf0-5544-83e0-b2d4c7da9e2f","kind":"gap","prompt":"Дополни предложение словом из пары: despite / provided.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The booking is valid ___ that payment arrives by noon."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["provided"]},"reference_answer":"provided","incorrect_answer":"despite","explanation":"Provided that вводит условие действительности бронирования."},{"id":"8ee23de2-998c-5995-95d7-9d909d03b008","lesson_id":"0bd5c454-ddf0-5544-83e0-b2d4c7da9e2f","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Комнатой можно пользоваться при условии соблюдения правил безопасности.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"is"},{"id":"t4","label":"available"},{"id":"t5","label":"provided"},{"id":"t6","label":"that"},{"id":"t7","label":"the"},{"id":"t8","label":"safety"},{"id":"t9","label":"rules"},{"id":"t10","label":"are"},{"id":"t11","label":"followed."},{"id":"t1","label":"The"},{"id":"t2","label":"room"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10","t11"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10","t11"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10","t11","t1"],"explanation":"Разрешение зависит от выполнения названного условия."},{"id":"af7fe141-a385-5323-acc7-3bae66a5d9b7","lesson_id":"0bd5c454-ddf0-5544-83e0-b2d4c7da9e2f","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь указанную конструкцию, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"We can proceed provided that everyone will follows the instructions."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["We can proceed provided that everyone follows the instructions."]},"reference_answer":"We can proceed provided that everyone follows the instructions.","incorrect_answer":"We can proceed provided that everyone will follows the instructions.","explanation":"Для реального будущего условия используется follows без will."},{"id":"74728cae-566a-550f-9835-22b8ab3ffd3b","lesson_id":"0bd5c454-ddf0-5544-83e0-b2d4c7da9e2f","kind":"reading","prompt":"Какие условия сопровождали разрешение?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"A community centre allowed a film club to use its hall provided that members left the exits clear and finished by ten. The club’s first announcement simply said that the hall had been approved, omitting the conditions. A volunteer noticed the omission before tickets were offered. The revised announcement included the finishing time and explained that chairs could not be placed in front of the side doors. Permission remained available, but it depended on compliance with those requirements rather than on the club’s enthusiasm alone.","options":[{"id":"v3c07c15d153c","label":"Clear exits and a finish by ten."},{"id":"vf8cb959afbb5","label":"Unlimited seating and an unrestricted finishing time."},{"id":"v97bc7a5bb9cc","label":"A requirement to close every exit."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v3c07c15d153c"},"reference_answer":"v3c07c15d153c","incorrect_answer":"vf8cb959afbb5","explanation":"Оба условия названы после provided that в первом предложении."},{"id":"f05b90a6-75c2-5c23-8aba-8c99cd2c5924","lesson_id":"0bd5c454-ddf0-5544-83e0-b2d4c7da9e2f","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова урока с переводом в указанном контексте.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"la713389e6bd6","label":"condition"},{"id":"l5f8768ff1c86","label":"permission"},{"id":"l4951b6f08ab9","label":"comply"},{"id":"lc82f8d4f64a3","label":"restriction"}],"right":[{"id":"r52352a0d9997","label":"соблюдать требования"},{"id":"r88d434eb877b","label":"ограничение"},{"id":"r1dbb7c75a508","label":"условие"},{"id":"r0a330623642c","label":"разрешение"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"la713389e6bd6":"r1dbb7c75a508","l5f8768ff1c86":"r0a330623642c","l4951b6f08ab9":"r52352a0d9997","lc82f8d4f64a3":"r88d434eb877b"}},"reference_answer":{"la713389e6bd6":"r1dbb7c75a508","l5f8768ff1c86":"r0a330623642c","l4951b6f08ab9":"r52352a0d9997","lc82f8d4f64a3":"r88d434eb877b"},"incorrect_answer":{"la713389e6bd6":"r0a330623642c","l5f8768ff1c86":"r1dbb7c75a508","l4951b6f08ab9":"r52352a0d9997","lc82f8d4f64a3":"r88d434eb877b"},"explanation":"В этих контекстах: condition — условие; permission — разрешение; comply — соблюдать требования; restriction — ограничение."},{"id":"399f8007-2686-5c6d-9981-556811407148","lesson_id":"0bd5c454-ddf0-5544-83e0-b2d4c7da9e2f","kind":"reading","prompt":"Почему объявление исправили?","position":7,"public_payload":{"passage":"A community centre allowed a film club to use its hall provided that members left the exits clear and finished by ten. The club’s first announcement simply said that the hall had been approved, omitting the conditions. A volunteer noticed the omission before tickets were offered. The revised announcement included the finishing time and explained that chairs could not be placed in front of the side doors. Permission remained available, but it depended on compliance with those requirements rather than on the club’s enthusiasm alone.","options":[{"id":"v7cfa0af1014c","label":"The centre had withdrawn all permission permanently."},{"id":"v6aa8e60f7a6e","label":"Every volunteer refused to help."},{"id":"v8154cacfd155","label":"It had omitted conditions attached to permission."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v8154cacfd155"},"reference_answer":"v8154cacfd155","incorrect_answer":"v7cfa0af1014c","explanation":"Разрешение не отменили; восстановили существенные условия его действия."},{"id":"fac86cda-68c6-5151-87e2-a3752ee6d1c9","lesson_id":"0bd5c454-ddf0-5544-83e0-b2d4c7da9e2f","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Разреши использование с понятным условием возврата.","position":8,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"May we borrow the projector?"}],"options":[{"id":"v609cdf6b497c","label":"Yes, provided that it is returned before Friday’s class."},{"id":"v619d5676e034","label":"Yes, provided that it will returned before Friday’s class."},{"id":"v4f51910fc5f2","label":"Yes, despite that it returning before Friday."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v609cdf6b497c"},"reference_answer":"v609cdf6b497c","incorrect_answer":"v619d5676e034","explanation":"Provided that + настоящее пассивное is returned выражает будущее условие."},{"id":"d0d3e62e-6cb3-56f8-85f1-9aafc6a19f4e","lesson_id":"0bd5c454-ddf0-5544-83e0-b2d4c7da9e2f","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"To act in accordance with stated requirements is to ___ with them.","options":[{"id":"vb91920c8678e","label":"compete"},{"id":"v66726c20c711","label":"conclude"},{"id":"v628fce356100","label":"comply"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v628fce356100"},"reference_answer":"v628fce356100","incorrect_answer":"vb91920c8678e","explanation":"Comply with означает соблюдать требования."},{"id":"b42a2645-ac99-57fe-aee0-c6405686f481","lesson_id":"5b553581-111e-5d61-9bc1-4fe164f26300","kind":"single_choice","prompt":"Выбери точный вариант: The first service is cheaper, ___ the second offers more flexible times.","position":1,"public_payload":{"options":[{"id":"v28d1fe9717dc","label":"whereas"},{"id":"v5e924bbf750d","label":"because of"},{"id":"v1d628b847d2e","label":"despite of"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v28d1fe9717dc"},"reference_answer":"v28d1fe9717dc","incorrect_answer":"v5e924bbf750d","explanation":"Whereas соединяет контрастирующие полноценные части."},{"id":"9ba33459-f304-5582-aca9-d620bac46b20","lesson_id":"5b553581-111e-5d61-9bc1-4fe164f26300","kind":"gap","prompt":"Дополни предложение словом из пары: is / being.","position":2,"public_payload":{"sentence":"Option A is fast, whereas option B ___ more reliable."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["is"]},"reference_answer":"is","incorrect_answer":"being","explanation":"После whereas здесь требуется самостоятельная часть с конечной формой is."},{"id":"71e30e62-fbda-54bc-938f-fd1c8a005585","lesson_id":"5b553581-111e-5d61-9bc1-4fe164f26300","kind":"sentence","prompt":"Собери предложение: «Первый вариант дешевле, тогда как второй надёжнее.»","position":3,"public_payload":{"tokens":[{"id":"t3","label":"option"},{"id":"t4","label":"is"},{"id":"t5","label":"cheaper,"},{"id":"t6","label":"whereas"},{"id":"t7","label":"the"},{"id":"t8","label":"second"},{"id":"t9","label":"is"},{"id":"t10","label":"more"},{"id":"t11","label":"reliable."},{"id":"t1","label":"The"},{"id":"t2","label":"first"}]},"answer_key":{"value":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10","t11"]},"reference_answer":["t1","t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10","t11"],"incorrect_answer":["t2","t3","t4","t5","t6","t7","t8","t9","t10","t11","t1"],"explanation":"Сопоставлены цена и надёжность без утверждения причинности."},{"id":"05af3f93-9be1-5f75-a0b7-8c1fef970020","lesson_id":"5b553581-111e-5d61-9bc1-4fe164f26300","kind":"correction","prompt":"Исправь указанную конструкцию, сохраняя остальные слова и смысл.","position":4,"public_payload":{"sentence":"The first route is shorter, whereas the second being safer."},"answer_key":{"accepted":["The first route is shorter, whereas the second is safer."]},"reference_answer":"The first route is shorter, whereas the second is safer.","incorrect_answer":"The first route is shorter, whereas the second being safer.","explanation":"После whereas нужна полная часть the second is safer."},{"id":"2d76afd9-c82d-5209-8a87-9d459c70dd85","lesson_id":"5b553581-111e-5d61-9bc1-4fe164f26300","kind":"reading","prompt":"Какое преимущество приписано живым занятиям?","position":5,"public_payload":{"passage":"A training provider compared two delivery methods. Recorded sessions were cheaper to repeat, whereas live sessions allowed participants to ask questions immediately. A summary described the recorded format as “better”, without stating which criterion it used. The course designer objected: lower repeat cost did not establish greater usefulness for learners who needed direct feedback. The team eventually offered recordings for revision and live meetings for discussion. The comparison had revealed complementary strengths rather than a universally superior method, and the final choice depended on the purpose of each activity.","options":[{"id":"v9b8a389d2737","label":"They are always cheaper to repeat."},{"id":"v18720ba10aa1","label":"They remove any need for recordings."},{"id":"v71bcb939fa57","label":"Participants can ask questions immediately."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v71bcb939fa57"},"reference_answer":"v71bcb939fa57","incorrect_answer":"v9b8a389d2737","explanation":"Это конкретное преимущество сравниваемого формата, а не всеобщее превосходство."},{"id":"0e56c35f-271c-5cd1-ad83-6f89dd5ba2a9","lesson_id":"5b553581-111e-5d61-9bc1-4fe164f26300","kind":"matching","prompt":"Соедини слова урока с переводом в указанном контексте.","position":6,"public_payload":{"left":[{"id":"l508be24a2fd6","label":"whereas"},{"id":"lc67eaadac07b","label":"criterion"},{"id":"l10d3acf3fb64","label":"reliability"},{"id":"l1cbe7c54ceed","label":"flexibility"}],"right":[{"id":"re6eea7054eeb","label":"надёжность"},{"id":"r308137a1178e","label":"гибкость"},{"id":"raa7824fde53b","label":"тогда как"},{"id":"rd796d5e36dc5","label":"критерий"}]},"answer_key":{"pairs":{"l508be24a2fd6":"raa7824fde53b","lc67eaadac07b":"rd796d5e36dc5","l10d3acf3fb64":"re6eea7054eeb","l1cbe7c54ceed":"r308137a1178e"}},"reference_answer":{"l508be24a2fd6":"raa7824fde53b","lc67eaadac07b":"rd796d5e36dc5","l10d3acf3fb64":"re6eea7054eeb","l1cbe7c54ceed":"r308137a1178e"},"incorrect_answer":{"l508be24a2fd6":"rd796d5e36dc5","lc67eaadac07b":"raa7824fde53b","l10d3acf3fb64":"re6eea7054eeb","l1cbe7c54ceed":"r308137a1178e"},"explanation":"В этих контекстах: whereas — тогда как; criterion — критерий; reliability — надёжность; flexibility — гибкость."},{"id":"f4e7035c-b57f-5524-8750-707f43d4cfa1","lesson_id":"5b553581-111e-5d61-9bc1-4fe164f26300","kind":"reading","prompt":"Почему слово better в кратком резюме было недостаточным?","position":7,"public_payload":{"passage":"A training provider compared two delivery methods. Recorded sessions were cheaper to repeat, whereas live sessions allowed participants to ask questions immediately. A summary described the recorded format as “better”, without stating which criterion it used. The course designer objected: lower repeat cost did not establish greater usefulness for learners who needed direct feedback. The team eventually offered recordings for revision and live meetings for discussion. The comparison had revealed complementary strengths rather than a universally superior method, and the final choice depended on the purpose of each activity.","options":[{"id":"v706bf29b3ddd","label":"Every learner had identical needs."},{"id":"v4408c4322061","label":"It did not identify the criterion used to judge the formats."},{"id":"vab69e4849946","label":"Recorded sessions had no possible use."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v4408c4322061"},"reference_answer":"v4408c4322061","incorrect_answer":"vab69e4849946","explanation":"Без критерия нельзя превратить отдельное преимущество в общую оценку."},{"id":"9d042cef-3347-5329-89ab-cca365723e2d","lesson_id":"5b553581-111e-5d61-9bc1-4fe164f26300","kind":"dialogue","prompt":"Сопоставь два достоинства без лишнего универсального вывода.","position":8,"public_payload":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Собеседник","text":"Which comparison avoids claiming that one option wins on every criterion?"}],"options":[{"id":"v9c22e86e2041","label":"A is cheaper, so it must be best for every purpose."},{"id":"v5a98f1e5e433","label":"B is flexible, so cost can never matter."},{"id":"vd7d5337863fc","label":"A is cheaper, whereas B offers more flexibility."}]},"answer_key":{"value":"vd7d5337863fc"},"reference_answer":"vd7d5337863fc","incorrect_answer":"v9c22e86e2041","explanation":"Whereas сохраняет контраст, не устанавливая абсолютного победителя."},{"id":"0b9661f8-3c91-560c-bdff-38ede2169867","lesson_id":"5b553581-111e-5d61-9bc1-4fe164f26300","kind":"context_choice","prompt":"Выбери слово по смыслу контекста.","position":9,"public_payload":{"sentence":"A standard used to judge alternatives is a ___.","options":[{"id":"v336c80a37eae","label":"receipt"},{"id":"v944cb685768a","label":"criterion"},{"id":"v228abe73ef36","label":"guarantee"}]},"answer_key":{"value":"v944cb685768a"},"reference_answer":"v944cb685768a","incorrect_answer":"v228abe73ef36","explanation":"Criterion — критерий оценки, не обещание определённого результата."}]}$curriculum_package$::jsonb);
